     // Queues a copy of the packet (blocks while too much is queued, so the worker cannot run far ahead).
+    // GOW-Port: packets are batched (PS2X_GS_STAGE_BATCH) and reach the stage on flush(); the worker flushes at the
+    // end of every job, before it reports idle.
